"""
Qwen2-SemaRoPE (Qwen2-SR) Model

This module implements Qwen2 with SemaRoPE (Semantic Rotary Position Embedding),
which enhances sliding window attention layers with semantic-aware positional encoding.

Key Features:
- SemaRoPE: Query-only semantic phase shifts, Key uses standard RoPE
- KV-cache compatible: Standard RoPE for Keys enables direct caching
- Bounded phase shifts: tanh + alpha scaling prevents excessive position偏移
- Sliding window attention: Efficient local context modeling

Model Architecture:
- Sliding window layers use SemaRoPE for context-aware positioning
- Full attention layers use standard RoPE
- Automatic switching based on layer_types configuration
"""
